# View helpers

## API shape

- **CardHelper**: stateless `render($body, $options)` — reserved keys: `header`, `footer`, `headerAttrs`, `bodyAttrs`, `footerAttrs`; other keys → card element attrs
- **BadgeHelper**: stateless `render($text, $options)` and color wrappers (`primary`, `secondary`, `success`, `danger`, `warning`, `info`, `light`, `dark`); `button($label, $text, $options)` for inline and positioned badges. Reserved render keys: `color`, `class`, `pill`, `tag`, `positioned`, `indicator`, `visuallyHidden`. `class` without `color` skips the default color class. `button()` also reserves `buttonAttrs` and `badgeAttrs`; other keys are badge options.
- **TableHelper**: fluent `header()`, `row()`, `body()` then `render()` — clears header/body/headerOptions on render
- **DescriptionHelper**: fluent `add()` then `render()` — clears rows on render; `list` option for `<dl>` attrs
- **NavHelper**: fluent `add()` / `addLink()` then `render()` or `renderNav()` — uses `Brammo/BootstrapUI.Icon` and Cake `Url`. Reserved item keys: `icon`, `namespace`, `prefix`, `size`, `active`, `disabled`
- **IconHelper**: stateless `icon($name, $options)` — reserved keys: `namespace`, `prefix`, `size`, `tag`, `class`. `class` is appended to the generated icon classes. Defaults: namespace `bi`, prefix `bi`, tag `i`
- **CarouselHelper**: fluent `add()` then `render()` — clears items on render; reserved render keys: `id`, `controls`, `indicators`, `crossfade`, `autoplay`, `carouselAttrs`, `innerAttrs`, `captionAttrs`

## Templates

Use `$_defaultConfig['templates']` and `$_defaultAttributes` with `mergeAttributes($template, $attrs)` (`$attrs + $defaults` — user keys win; `class` is replaced, not merged unless handled explicitly).

## Changes

- Update matching tests in `tests/TestCase/View/Helper/`
- Update the matching doc in `docs/` when public options or documented behavior change
